143
00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.760
Se complementan.

144
00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.220
Para un plan grande,

145
00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:04.680
claudex.

146
00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.260
Para lo demás —revisar un diff,

147
00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.660
una meta con parada,

148
00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:08.880
