149
00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:09.700
Use Both.

150
00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.700
Un caso real.

151
00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.180
En INEMA, Claude Code llama a Codex

152
00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.280
